228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Our Corporate Training Services have been developed for over the last four decades, which help support your employees enhance their work productivity, self-esteem, and professional growth. Our training programs are designed keeping customization in mind, catering to your immediate business needs, and help you achieve your goals and capture success faster. Our soft and business skills development programs will assist your employees \(both management & staff\) to build-on their motivation and accelerate their growth professionally, while developing sound industry knowledge required for achieving new frontiers for your company. Our instructors and consultants come with an expertise of an average tenure of 12 years with NADIA Global, facilitating the best learning through an exceptional standard of training. We are experts in the design, development, and facilitation of structured courses that deliver a 100% success-rate. We provide Virtual Instructor-Led Training \(VILT\) and face-to-face training. Our instructors also travel overseas to facilitate client training upon request.)
/E (Our Corporate Training Services have been developed for over the last four decades, which help support your employees enhance their work productivity, self-esteem, and professional growth. Our training programs are designed keeping customization in mind, catering to your immediate business needs, and help you achieve your goals and capture success faster. Our soft and business skills development programs will assist your employees \(both management & staff\) to build-on their motivation and accelerate their growth professionally, while developing sound industry knowledge required for achieving new frontiers for your company. Our instructors and consultants come with an expertise of an average tenure of 12 years with NADIA Global, facilitating the best learning through an exceptional standard of training. We are experts in the design, development, and facilitation of structured courses that deliver a 100% success-rate. We provide Virtual Instructor-Led Training \(VILT\) and face-to-face training. Our instructors also travel overseas to facilitate client training upon request.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [0]
